      },
      {
        "icon": "location",
        "header": "Application Site",
        "text": "",
        "bullets": [
          "Apply sensor to the back of the upper arm",
          "Choose an area with adequate subcutaneous fat",
          "Avoid areas with scars, moles, stretch marks, or lumps",
          "Rotate application sites between arms",
          "Do not apply over tattoos or irritated skin",
          "Clean the skin with an alcohol swab before application",
          "Monitor skin condition regularly for any adverse reactions"
